<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Fianna Fáil</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Fianna Fáil is an Irish political party founded in 1926 by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/eamon-de-valera">Éamon de Valera</a> and opponents of the Anglo-Irish Treaty. It entered government in 1932 and became the dominant party of independent Ireland, leading most governments for the rest of the century. It drove the 1937 constitution and pursued economic self-sufficiency.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/fianna-fail.jpg" alt="Fianna Fáil" width="320" height="136" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Fianna Fáil · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fianna_F%C3%A1il_logo_(2024).svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
